<main class="about-main">
    <div class="about-container">
        <h1 class="about-title">ABOUT US</h1>
        <section class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p><strong class="strong-text-highlight" style="font-size: 20px;">NGUYEN THANH GALLERY</strong> is a contemporary art gallery established in 2000+ in Vietnam and directed by Nguyen Trang. The gallery operates as a professional commercial gallery, with a program centered on abstract and contemporary painting.</p>
                <p>Over more than two decades, <strong class="strong-text-highlight" style="font-size: 20px;">NGUYEN THANH GALLERY</strong> has developed a practice-based approach, working closely with artists through long-term artistic development. The gallery collaborates with artists in the selection of artworks and the construction of cohesive series. Each artist represented by the gallery is supported through the publication of a dedicated catalogue.</p>
                <p>The gallery represents artists whose works engage with themes drawn from everyday life, nature, human presence, and the contemporary urban environment. Oil on canvas is a primary medium, and stylistically the gallery focuses on abstract impressionist and semi-abstract approaches.</p>
                <p><strong class="strong-text-highlight" style="font-size: 20px;">NGUYEN THANH GALLERY</strong> has participated in exhibitions and international art fairs, including Red Dot Miami (USA), where the gallery received the Spotlight Award (December 2025).</p>
                <p>In addition to the artists it represents, <strong class="strong-text-highlight" style="font-size: 20px;">NGUYEN THANH GALLERY</strong> also presents selected works from private collections and secondary market holdings.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
